<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney</p>
<p>International tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia)</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6) 6-1</p>
<p>Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-1.</p>
<p>Men's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 1-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>3-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-4 6-2.</p>
</text>
